Package: ARMS
Type: Package
Title: Adaptive Resolution Multiscale Spatial DNA sequencing
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rao", "Srinivasa",           
    email = "srinivasa.rao@nds.ox.ac.uk",
    role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Cristian", "Soitu",           
    email = "soitu.cristi@gmail.com",
           role = "aut"))
Description: ARMS provides a complete workflow for detecting copy number alterations in
    spatial genomics data. It wraps ASCAT.sc for single-cell copy
    number calling, performs hierarchical clustering to identify clonal
    populations, and generates publication-ready visualizations including
    heatmaps and spatial maps. The package supports pseudobulk analysis
    for improved signal-to-noise ratio.
